// Settings screen.
//
// Single-column scrollable content inside the app shell — no Settings-
// specific sidebar. Sections are stacked top-to-bottom, each one its
// own Card. Per Pyor conventions:
//   - Section title sits at the top of the card.
//   - Description directly under the title.
//   - Rows separated by 0.5px lines, last row borderless (handled via
//     Tailwind `last:border-b-0` rather than a prop, so callers don't
//     have to remember to mark the tail row).
//   - Inputs lean on shadcn primitives (Select, Switch) so future
//     additions inherit the same look.

